---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';

export const prerender = true;
---

<PageLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  eyebrow="Legal"
  description={`Important information about the home-decor content published by ${SITE.name}.`}
  lede="How to use our ideas, guides and recommendations responsibly."
  updated="October 2, 2026"
>
  <p>
    The content on {SITE.name} is for general information and inspiration. We share home-decor
    ideas, styling suggestions, product information and do-it-yourself projects. It is not a
    substitute for advice tailored to your home or circumstances.
  </p>

  <h2>Projects and safety</h2>
  <p>
    A project that works in one home may not be suitable for another. Before using tools, changing
    fixtures, mounting items, painting or working with materials, read the product instructions and
    assess the risks in your space. Follow applicable building, electrical and fire-safety rules,
    use appropriate protective equipment, and consult a qualified professional when a project
    involves structural, electrical, plumbing or other specialist work. You are responsible for
    deciding whether an idea is safe and suitable for you.
  </p>

  <h2>Products, prices and availability</h2>
  <p>
    Products, prices, dimensions, materials and availability may change after an article is
    published. Check current details with the seller or manufacturer before making a purchase or
    relying on a product specification. Mention of a product is not a guarantee or endorsement of
    its performance in every home.
  </p>

  <h2>Affiliate links and advertising</h2>
  <p>
    Some pages contain affiliate links, and the site may display advertising. We may earn a
    commission if you buy through an affiliate link, at no additional cost to you. Paid placements
    and affiliate relationships are disclosed in the relevant content and described in our
    <a href="/disclosure/">Disclosure</a>. Advertising or a link does not guarantee or certify a
    third party's products or services.
  </p>

  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>
    Links to other websites are offered as a convenience. We do not control and are not responsible
    for their content, accuracy, availability, products or privacy practices. Visiting or buying
    from a third-party site is your choice and subject to its own terms and policies.
  </p>

  <h2>Corrections and questions</h2>
  <p>
    We aim to keep our content useful and accurate, but errors or outdated details can happen. If
    you spot something that needs attention, please contact us at
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
